## Direct Script Wrappers

The standalone numbered scripts remain available for backward compatibility:
- `01_extract_and_prepare_ligand.py`
- `02_run_acpype.py` (and `02_run_acpype.sh`)
- `03_ligand_invacuo.py` (and `03_ligand_invacuo.sh`)
- `04_prepare_protein.py`
- `05_merge_topologies.py`
- `06_solvate_ions_index.py`
- `07_energy_minimization.py`
- `08_hpc_equi_prod.py`
- `09_hpc_submit.pbs` / `09_hpc_submit.sbatch`
